OL,3,ASally Rooney books withdrawn in UK over
OL,4,APalestine Action support
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement to BBC News, Rooney said
OL,7,Ffurther publication of her work could
OL,8,Fconstitute a "serious criminal
OL,9,Foffence", so she had agreed with her
OL,10,Fpublisher Faber not to continue
OL,11,Fsupplying her books in the UK.
OL,13,F"I have made every effort to be honest
OL,14,Fwith the public about my beliefs and
OL,15,Fintentions, and I am wholly prepared to
OL,16,Faccept the consequences," she said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
