OL,3,ARussell Brand was a 'sexual predator',
OL,4,Aprosecution alleges as rape trial
OL,5,Abegins
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand was described as
OL,8,F"ruthless" and a "sexual predator" by
OL,9,Fthe prosecution at the start of his
OL,10,Ftrial for rape and sexual assault on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,13,FThe 51-year-old actor and comedian
OL,14,Ffaces three counts of rape, three
OL,15,Fcharges of sexual assault and one of
OL,16,Findecent assault.
OL,18,FThe allegations, made by six female
OL,19,Fcomplainants, span a 10-year period
OL,20,Fbetween 1999 and 2009. He denies the
OL,21,Fcharges.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
