OL,3,ARetired US generals call on Pentagon to
OL,4,Acancel 'barbaric' execution livestream
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week, the Pentagon announced it
OL,7,Fwould publicly show the 3 December
OL,8,Fexecution of Nidal Hasan, an Army
OL,9,Fpsychiatrist who shot dead 13 unarmed
OL,10,FUS soldiers at the Fort Hood military
OL,11,Fbase.
OL,13,FLawmakers from both parties, as well as
OL,14,Freligious leaders, have criticised the
OL,15,Fplan.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
